        <mxCell id="c9" value="&lt;b&gt;+$4,582.37&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;The three cutoff invoices, &lt;span style=&quot;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;SI-2026-013741&lt;/span&gt; to &lt;span style=&quot;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;SI-2026-013743&lt;/span&gt;, dated 2025 and posted 2026-01-01. The ledger has them in 2026; InvoiceLines does not. Only &lt;span style=&quot;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;SI-2026-013742&lt;/span&gt; ($3,233.18) shipped in 2025." style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#5D6D7E;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="372" y="84.5" width="488" height="59" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
